  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&bull;<strong> Brand introduction:</strong> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to Isobiotics, your one-stop solution for holistic health and wellness. We are pioneers in the field of medical diagnostics and personalised healthcare, committed to revolutionising the way you approach your well-being. Our mission is simple: to empower you with the knowledge and tools you need to live your healthiest life.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1 ContentPasted0\" style=\"margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: none; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At Isobiotics, we offer cutting-edge medical testing that goes beyond traditional methods to give you a comprehensive understanding of your health. Our state-of-the-art laboratories are equipped with the latest technology to ensure accurate and timely results. But we don't stop at diagnosis; we take it a step further.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1 ContentPasted0\" style=\"margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: none; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Understanding that each individual is unique, we provide personalised supplements tailored to your specific needs. Sourced from the highest quality ingredients and formulated by experts, our supplements aim to fill the gaps in your nutrition and boost your overall health.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&bull; Product description:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Discover the key to optimal health with our comprehensive blood tests, food intolerance assessments, and personalised supplements. Our advanced blood tests provide crucial insights into your overall well-being, while our food intolerance evaluations help identify dietary triggers affecting your health. Unlock a tailored wellness journey with our personalised supplements, expertly formulated to meet your unique nutritional needs. Take control of your health today with Isobiotics.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">At Isobiotics, we don't just diagnose; we personalise. Our advanced medical tests decode your unique health profile, while our custom-formulated supplements are tailored to fill your specific nutritional gaps. Plus, our dedicated aftercare ensures you're never alone on your wellness journey. Experience healthcare that's as unique as you are.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&bull; Payment terms:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The last friday of every month.</span></p>",
